        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin Clear Glass Fillmore 5080 Knob With 5048 Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Baldwin made 5080 Fillmore knobset is made to fit a 1-3/8 inch thick door with 2-3/8 inch backset. The time honored elegance of the Fillmore Knob is illustrated in the fine cuts in the glass as well as in the the classic rose. Everything about this knobset is reminiscent of sophistication and beauty.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin 5080 Fillmore Knob With 5048 Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" standard door preparation.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed mounting to hide unsightly installation screws.</li>\r\n<li>Forged from solid brass for maximum strength and durability.</li>\r\n<li>28 degree latch rotation</li>\r\n<li>Heavy duty latch bolts springs.</li>\r\n<li>Latches are reversible for all door conditions.</li>\r\n<li>Latches include standard full lip strike.</li>\r\n<li>Latches include anti-friction insert for smooth operation</li></ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Baldwin Fillmore Glass Knobset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2.53\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2.19\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2.69\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim. </li>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button located on rose. An emergency release function allows the knob to automatically unlock when it is turned from the inside.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Glass Filmore Knob With Traditional Rose, Baldwin 5080",
                "description": "Baldwin Clear Glass Fillmore 5080 Knob With 5048 Rosette - This Baldwin made knobset is made to fit a 1-3/8 inch thick door with 2-3/8 inch backset.  The time honored elegance of the Fillmore Knob is illustrated in the fine cuts in the glass as well as in the the classic rose. Everything about this knobset is reminiscent of sophistication and beauty. It is available in five stunning finishes.",
